        <h1>Multimedia & Animation 📚</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
            Basic multimedia and animation study materials.
        </p>

        <div class="topic">
            <h2>1. What is Multimedia?</h2>

            <p>
                Multimedia is the combination of different types
                of media such as text, images, audio, video and animation
                to communicate information.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="topic">
            <h2>2. Types of Multimedia</h2>

            <p>
                Multimedia can include text, graphics, audio,
                video and animation.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="topic">
            <h2>3. Animation</h2>

            <p>
                Animation is the process of creating the appearance
                of movement by displaying a sequence of images or frames.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="topic">
            <h2>4. Keyframe</h2>

            <p>
                A keyframe represents an important position or
                change in an animation sequence.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="topic">
            <h2>5. Audio and Video</h2>

            <p>
                Audio represents sound information, while video
                represents moving visual information.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

